        "title": "feat(providers): add LongCat API support",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nLongCat-2.0 is available through LongCat's hosted OpenAI-compatible API, but OpenClaw users currently need to hand-author a custom provider block. That skips native onboarding, secret discovery, catalog metadata, reasoning replay compatibility, and standard provider documentation.\n\nFixes #100485.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis adds a bundled `longcat` provider plugin with `LONGCAT_API_KEY` onboarding, a static `LongCat-2.0` catalog, and the hosted `https://api.longcat.chat/openai` endpoint. The implementation reuses the existing OpenAI-compatible transport while declaring LongCat's binary `thinking` payload, `reasoning_content` replay requirement, 1M context, 128K output limit, and published pricing.\n\nA small shared compatibility fix makes manifest-declared `requiresReasoningContentOnAssistantMessages` survive catalog normalization and prevents DeepSeek-format providers from sending `reasoning_effort` when `supportsReasoningEffort` is false.\n\nThe hosted provider remains separate from self-hosted weights: local LongCat-2.0 deployments should use the existing vLLM or SGLang providers instead of adding a second LongCat runtime path.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers can run `openclaw onboard --auth-choice longcat-api-key`, select `longcat/LongCat-2.0`, and use LongCat reasoning/tool-call sessions without manual provider JSON.\n\nThe live generation test is key-gated with `LONGCAT_API_KEY`. It is intentionally pending until a maintainer supplies a live API key; deterministic catalog, onboarding, payload, replay, lint, type, build, and transport proof are included now.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Official contract checked against LongCat API docs, OpenClaw guide, pricing page, and the LongCat-2.0 Hugging Face model card.\n- Live unauthenticated model discovery: `GET /openai/v1/models` returned `LongCat-2.0`.\n- Live auth boundary: invalid-key `POST /openai/v1/chat/completions` returned HTTP 401 with `invalid_api_key`.\n- Focused local proof: 40 core/model-catalog tests and 4 LongCat plugin tests passed.\n- Crabbox/Testbox focused proof: 44 tests passed on `tbx_01kwt7dw4fts3zs2vx991yczdv`.\n- Crabbox/Testbox changed gate: all guards, full tsgo, all oxlint shards, and import-cycle checks passed on `tbx_01kwtbrfbkcrxd4s1bgfr1dgxq` (6m16s).\n- Crabbox/Testbox build: `pnpm build` passed on `tbx_01kwtbrfbkcrxd4s1bgfr1dgxq` (1m26s).\n- Docs: formatter, MDX validation, internal link audit, plugin inventory check, and docs map check passed.\n- Autoreview: clean; no accepted/actionable findings (`patch is correct`, confidence 0.83).\n",
